        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add the lack of proper gamut mapping in OKLch and Oklab. The browser support is thus only parial.]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26841</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/26841"/>
        <updated>2025-06-01T02:44:58.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54515?u=b3091d8543234ab43ceedae962b178688740b617&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h4 dir="auto">Summary</h4>
<p dir="auto">The current browser implementation of gamut mapping is buggy and not spec compliant. This has accessibility ramifications (the spec ensures that color contrast is preserved, even if a color is beyond what a user can display, but browser don't respect that invariant in their implementation).</p>
<h4 dir="auto">Test results and supporting details</h4>
<p dir="auto">Visit <a href="https://vasilis.nl/dingen/bugs/oklch.html" rel="nofollow">https://vasilis.nl/dingen/bugs/oklch.html</a></p>
<p dir="auto">The squares should be white and black per spec, they aren't in any browser.</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1933631613" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/9449" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/9449/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/9449">w3c/csswg-drafts#9449</a></li>
<li><a href="https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=255939" rel="nofollow">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=255939</a></li>
<li><a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1847421" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1847421</a></li>
<li><a href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40909194" rel="nofollow">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40909194</a></li>
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1340067398" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/7610" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/7610/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/7610">w3c/csswg-drafts#7610</a></li>
<li><a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="1354160102" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/7653" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/7653/hovercard" href="https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/7653">w3c/csswg-drafts#7653</a></li>
</ul>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
<p dir="auto">This <span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #26838.">fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3074538627" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26838" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26838/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26838">#26838</a></p>]]></content>
